sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Client Browser
    participant KAP as kube-auth-proxy<br/>4180/TCP HTTP
    participant OIDC as OIDC Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OSAUTH as OpenShift OAuth<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>TCP Optional TLS
    participant Upstream as Upstream App<br/>Configurable

    Note over Browser, Upstream: Flow 1: OIDC Authentication
    Browser->>KAP: GET /oauth2/start<br/>No auth
    KAP->>Browser: 302 Redirect to OIDC Provider<br/>client_id, redirect_uri, PKCE
    Browser->>OIDC: GET /authorize<br/>TLS 1.2+
    OIDC->>Browser: 302 Redirect with auth code
    Browser->>KAP: GET /oauth2/callback<br/>CSRF cookie + auth code
    KAP->>OIDC: POST /token<br/>Client credentials + auth code<br/>TLS 1.2+
    OIDC-->>KAP: ID Token + Access Token
    KAP->>Redis: Store session (optional)<br/>Encrypted session data
    KAP->>Browser: Set-Cookie + 302 to original URL

    Note over Browser, Upstream: Flow 2: Authenticated Request (Session)
    Browser->>KAP: GET /* with session cookie
    KAP->>Redis: Load session (if Redis store)
    Redis-->>KAP: Session data
    KAP->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>X-Forwarded-User, X-Forwarded-Email,<br/>X-Forwarded-Groups headers
    Upstream-->>KAP: Response
    KAP-->>Browser: Proxied response

    Note over Browser, Upstream: Flow 3: K8s Service Account Token Validation
    Browser->>KAP: GET /* with Bearer token<br/>Authorization: Bearer <sa-token>
    KAP->>KAP: Check SHA-256 token cache
    alt Cache miss
        KAP->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>ServiceAccount token, TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>KAP: TokenReview response (authenticated, username, groups)
        KAP->>KAP: Cache result (TTL 10s default)
    end
    KAP->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>X-Forwarded-User header
    Upstream-->>KAP: Response
    KAP-->>Browser: Proxied response

    Note over Browser, Upstream: Flow 4: Envoy ext_authz Check
    Browser->>KAP: GET /oauth2/auth<br/>Bearer token or session cookie<br/>(forwarded by Envoy)
    KAP->>KAP: Validate token/session<br/>(K8s TokenReview / OIDC / OAuth)
    alt Authenticated
        KAP-->>Browser: HTTP 200<br/>X-Auth-Request-User,<br/>X-Auth-Request-Email headers
    else Unauthenticated
        KAP-->>Browser: HTTP 401
    else Unauthorized
        KAP-->>Browser: HTTP 403
    end
